    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract reasoning and concrete logic—something that aligns perfectly with my analytical mind but also demands patience. I enjoy its precision, like solving puzzles with structured steps, much like how I appreciate philosophy’s depth while painting or playing board games for creativity.",
