    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I admire tools that adapt explanations—like classical music’s improvisation skills improving my ability to explain concepts simply. Future teachers might use LLMs to tailor examples (e.g., algebra through cooking recipes), making abstract ideas tangible.",
